# Unity: generated folders and IDE files (only Assets/, Packages/ and ProjectSettings/ are kept)
**/Library/
**/Temp/
**/Logs/
**/obj/
**/Build/
**/Builds/
**/Build*/
**/UserSettings/
**/MemoryCaptures/
**/*.csproj
**/*.sln
**/*.slnx
**/*.pidb
**/*.userprefs
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.DS_Store

# generated by scripts/unity-export/export-all.mjs (every world, the shared store, the characters) and
# recorded by scripts/unity-export/record-sounds.mjs (needs a dev server): run them before opening the project
Memento/Assets/StreamingAssets/*

# build leftovers (the Android build's CMake staging, plugin copies)
Memento/.utmp/
Memento/Data/

# the JS bridge's runtime (docs/systems/engine-bridge.md): Puerts' packages, fetched by
# scripts/unity-js-setup.sh from its GitHub release (the V8 plug-ins are 80 MB), embedded here
Memento/Packages/com.tencent.puerts.*/
# Puerts' IL2CPP glue for the bridge's players (BridgeBuild.Il2cpp makes it)
Memento/Assets/Gen/
Memento/Assets/Gen.meta
# the testers' APK's icon (BridgeBuild.AndroidRelease copies public/icons/icon-512.png in)
Memento/Assets/MementoJS/Icon/
Memento/Assets/MementoJS/Icon.meta
